      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present three children who underwent coronary angioplasty for the surgical treatment of a congenital obstruction of the left main coronary artery. An azygos vein patch or graft was a feasible and useful material for reconstructing congenital ostial stenosis and atresia of the left main coronary artery."},
